  "notes": [
    "The candidate retains direct byte/uint32/uint64 stores and the complete xxh3 hash. A first streaming transition copies exactly the written prefix, then saturates the inline length to 128 so primitive capacity checks alone route later writes to the existing hasher. Hash, byte-slice and string paths retain their overflow-pointer checks. Original relation maps remain unchanged; numeric relation keys and the CommonJS prepass guard are reverted. Focused normal/race/checkptr evidence is separate; these CLI suites do not imply a race-instrumented CLI build.",
    "These suites compare diagnostics, API results, emitted outputs and project behavior; correctness is not inferred from compiler exit status alone.",
    "Go units and full pinned upstream conformance are recorded separately for this source digest.",
    "Go source immutability does not independently hash external module contents or every JavaScript harness/fixture file. SHOW_FAILURES is unset to prevent masking API differential failures; exactly one expected scriptc platform package is required.",
    "Validation durations are not performance measurements."
